<title>CHINA: China Jan-June rubber imports climb 10.2 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June rubber imports climb 10.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 230,000 tonnes of natural rubber, including latex, in the first six months, up by 10.2 percent from the same period of 1996, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	   IMPORTS JAN-JUNE    JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE</p>
<p>Rubber</p>
<p> including  230,000	   30,000	+10.2</p>
<p>latex</p>
<p>Synthetic</p>
<p> rubber     198,889	   32,174	+19.1</p>
<p>including</p>
<p>latex</p>
<p>Note: figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>Imports of natural rubber, including latex, were 550,000 tonnes in 1996, up 72.1 from 1995.</p>
<p>Imports of synthetic rubber, including latex, in 1996 were 367,456 tonnes, a rise of 17.9 percent compared with the previous year.</p>
</text>
